    "value": "Complete ordinary source-uniform signed comparison on qK>=26/27,0<=rho<=1/100000,r<=1/520. All52 original tests, five denominator objectives, both orientations, the whole valid first-beta face, every infinite count/exponent tail and one actual residual are retained. Exactly21 missing objectives are recomputed; five exact denominator head certificates are reused by a proved constant transport. No new global K, Lean theorem or unrestricted Erdos7 resolution."
